   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Solve the following system of equations. Check to see if your solution makes each equation true.</span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}3x\\;+\\;y\\;=\\;6\\\\x\\;+\\;2y\\;=\\;7\\end{array}\\right.\">\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}3x\\;+\\;y\\;=\\;6\\\\x\\;+\\;2y\\;=\\;7\\end{array}\\right.</span></p>",
